# Aeromagnetic total-field anomaly color ramp — nT.
# gdaldem color-relief format: <value> <r> <g> <b> [<a>]
# Diverging cmap centered on zero; transparent for nodata.
# Stops tuned for typical CONUS aeromag range (~-500 to +1000 nT,
# asymmetric because positive anomalies from mafic intrusives /
# magnetic basement push much higher than the negative side).
#
# Adjust stops if the source GeoTIFF uses different units (e.g. µT)
# or a residual-field calculation with a different zero reference.

nv 0 0 0 0
-1000 30 0 100 220
 -500 30 60 180 220
 -300 60 130 220 220
 -150 140 200 240 220
  -50 200 230 245 220
    0 255 255 255 220
   50 255 240 200 220
  150 255 200 120 220
  300 255 140 50 220
  500 240 70 30 220
 1000 180 0 20 220
 2000 100 0 30 220
